When the `native` Cargo feature is enabled the build also pulls in the
platform graphics frameworks the OS exposes:

- macOS / iOS : Metal.framework          (system, Apple LLC)
- Windows     : D3D12 / DXGI             (system, Microsoft Corp.)
- Linux       : libvulkan + libwayland   (LunarG / freedesktop.org)
                or libGL / libEGL        (Khronos)

The optional Three.js adapter (`three-adapter.ts`) targets the
`three` package:

